1
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:12,240
I've already talked to Jing
on the phone.

2
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,350
Mr. Song's life isn't in danger.

3
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,369
It was mainly brought on
by acute emotional stress

4
00:00:16,411 --> 00:00:17,830
and high blood pressure.

5
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,230
So he might show some signs of a stroke.

6
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,920
He needs rest and observation.

7
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:27,480
Yu Song,

8
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:29,030
I'm so scared.

9
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,190
I'm scared to fall asleep.

10
00:00:31,710 --> 00:00:32,840
Right now, I feel like

11
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:35,110
Song Jing's shadow

12
00:00:35,640 --> 00:00:37,840
is all over this room.

13
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:40,129
Don't be scared.

14
00:00:40,171 --> 00:00:41,030
I'm here.

15
00:00:41,600 --> 00:00:43,219
Let me help you take a hot bath first,

16
00:00:43,261 --> 00:00:44,000
alright?

17
00:00:44,840 --> 00:00:45,619
Okay.

18
00:00:45,661 --> 00:00:46,430
Let's go.

19
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:52,840
Cheng.

20
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:56,110
Has Jing come by recently
to put on new tires?

21
00:00:56,790 --> 00:00:58,560
Given how much you drive for work,

22
00:00:59,240 --> 00:01:01,520
your tires should be pretty worn by now.

23
00:01:09,310 --> 00:01:11,560
It's been pretty cold lately.

24
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:13,710
I've been indoors more.

25
00:01:14,710 --> 00:01:16,920
And last time the mechanic came,

26
00:01:17,120 --> 00:01:19,920
I had him do some maintenance
on the tires.

27
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:21,920
So they look pretty new.

28
00:01:24,200 --> 00:01:25,000
=Dear Song=
Yeah.

29
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:26,760
Okay.

30
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:28,200
Let's go.

31
00:01:29,780 --> 00:01:32,220
=Episode 20=
(Her Game)

32
00:01:44,310 --> 00:01:45,310
Mr. Song.

33
00:01:46,350 --> 00:01:47,200
You're awake.

34
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,150
Yu Song.

35
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:51,400
How come it's you?

36
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:56,710
Do you remember who I am?

37
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:59,150
Who are you?

38
00:01:59,760 --> 00:02:00,560
Then

39
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:04,640
do you remember Yu Pingjiang?

40
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:11,520
What did you say?

41
00:02:16,630 --> 00:02:17,750
Listen carefully.

42
00:02:19,910 --> 00:02:21,000
My last name is Yu.

43
00:02:23,150 --> 00:02:24,750
Yu, as in Yu Pingjiang.

44
00:02:28,120 --> 00:02:29,240
Back then,

45
00:02:29,840 --> 00:02:33,150
you smiled as you pushed my dad
into the sea.

46
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,710
For over a decade,

47
00:02:39,430 --> 00:02:41,819
I've been dragging

48
00:02:41,861 --> 00:02:43,430
your children

49
00:02:43,520 --> 00:02:45,150
and the whole Song family

50
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:46,910
into hell, bit by bit.

51
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:49,539
You're...

52
00:02:49,581 --> 00:02:50,400
You're that...

53
00:02:50,750 --> 00:02:51,560
Yes.

54
00:02:52,960 --> 00:02:55,910
I'm the little girl
who didn't die that day.

55
00:02:56,310 --> 00:02:58,400
Song Huan, Song Lin,

56
00:02:59,000 --> 00:02:59,840
and Zhao Hui.

57
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:01,910
Every one of them leaving,

58
00:03:03,240 --> 00:03:05,120
everyone turning their back on you,

59
00:03:07,310 --> 00:03:09,030
your prized Song Group slipping away...

60
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:11,499
Every single one of these

61
00:03:11,541 --> 00:03:13,310
is my payback to you.

62
00:03:14,430 --> 00:03:15,520
Do you like it?

63
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:17,030
I should have...

64
00:03:17,190 --> 00:03:18,280
I should have...

65
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:21,219
You should have killed me too,

66
00:03:21,261 --> 00:03:22,030
right?

67
00:03:24,710 --> 00:03:26,030
Too bad.

68
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,190
You don't get that chance anymore.

69
00:03:35,630 --> 00:03:36,840
Song Huaishan,

70
00:03:39,910 --> 00:03:43,310
I want you to open your eyes wide
and watch

71
00:03:45,190 --> 00:03:48,000
as I tear apart everything you have

72
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:51,360
piece by piece.

73
00:03:51,960 --> 00:03:53,569
The day Song Group

74
00:03:53,611 --> 00:03:55,960
goes down for good,

75
00:03:56,430 --> 00:03:58,520
I'll personally send you

76
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,120
to the bottom of the sea

77
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:04,750
to fall to your knees before my father
and beg for forgiveness.

78
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,390
Thanks for seeing me off.

79
00:04:46,830 --> 00:04:47,920
You really don't hate me?

80
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:50,390
Of course I do.

81
00:04:52,360 --> 00:04:53,360
That's exactly why

82
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:56,190
I need to get a good look at your face.

83
00:04:58,560 --> 00:04:59,720
More than I hate you,

84
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,510
I envy Song Cheng.

85
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:04,310
A crippled bunny like her

86
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,190
gets to have you by her side,

87
00:05:06,560 --> 00:05:07,720
shielding her

88
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:08,830
and planning everything for her.

89
00:05:10,120 --> 00:05:10,920
And me?

90
00:05:11,950 --> 00:05:13,019
I've only ever

91
00:05:13,061 --> 00:05:14,310
had myself.

92
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,120
I win alone.

93
00:05:17,040 --> 00:05:18,160
I lose alone.

94
00:05:18,510 --> 00:05:19,920
Stop fishing for sympathy.

95
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,809
The assets you moved overseas
from Nigang

96
00:05:22,851 --> 00:05:24,920
are enough for you to make a comeback
and do whatever you want.

97
00:05:28,510 --> 00:05:29,310
Yu Song.

98
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:31,040
I was right about you.

99
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:32,720
You really are more ruthless than me.

100
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:35,040
You know how to use
everything around you.

101
00:05:35,390 --> 00:05:36,920
Sympathy and feelings,

102
00:05:37,510 --> 00:05:38,630
for example.

103
00:05:39,270 --> 00:05:40,600
That dear little sister of mine,

104
00:05:40,830 --> 00:05:41,920
your fang,

105
00:05:43,510 --> 00:05:46,510
really does go for the enemy's throat
faster than I do.

106
00:05:54,950 --> 00:05:56,600
I left a copy of A Game of Thrones

107
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,720
in my office drawer.

108
00:05:59,240 --> 00:06:01,310
I left something for you in that book.

109
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:04,190
Consider it my last gift to you.

110
00:06:11,830 --> 00:06:12,630
I'll be waiting for you.

111
00:06:13,510 --> 00:06:14,950
Waiting for you to set new rules.

112
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:28,950
Watch out for the people around you.

113
00:06:30,310 --> 00:06:31,630
Song Cheng isn't as simple as she looks.

114
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:55,950
Song Huan!

115
00:07:02,190 --> 00:07:03,310
Huan.

116
00:07:04,560 --> 00:07:06,310
How did this happen so suddenly?

117
00:07:09,120 --> 00:07:09,920
Yu Song.

118
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:13,750
Can you go handle Huan's
hospital admission paperwork?

119
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:16,409
Okay.

120
00:07:16,451 --> 00:07:17,539
I'll be right back.

121
00:07:17,581 --> 00:07:18,360
Yeah.

122
00:07:39,310 --> 00:07:40,120
Huan.

123
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,190
Does it hurt?

124
00:07:47,310 --> 00:07:49,720
I put something in your pain pump.

125
00:07:50,390 --> 00:07:51,830
From now on,

126
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:55,190
you can only listen and watch.

127
00:07:55,830 --> 00:07:56,800
Can't do

128
00:07:58,510 --> 00:07:59,720
anything else.

129
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:11,120
Never imagined

130
00:08:12,270 --> 00:08:13,800
you'd end up like this one day.

131
00:08:20,630 --> 00:08:22,000
My legs.

132
00:08:24,310 --> 00:08:26,120
That car accident
was your doing, wasn't it?

133
00:08:27,310 --> 00:08:29,169
Just because Dad said

134
00:08:29,211 --> 00:08:31,510
he might give me a 5% stake for free,

135
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:35,030
you kept me trapped
in this wheelchair for so long!

136
00:08:42,510 --> 00:08:43,440
Now

137
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:46,459
it's your turn

138
00:08:46,501 --> 00:08:48,600
to know what it feels like
to lose the use of your legs.

139
00:09:10,390 --> 00:09:11,440
See that?

140
00:09:11,790 --> 00:09:13,510
I'm still a little unsteady,

141
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,579
but soon

142
00:09:15,621 --> 00:09:17,960
I'll be walking normally again.

143
00:09:26,440 --> 00:09:27,240
From now on,

144
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,000
your path

145
00:09:29,440 --> 00:09:31,200
is mine to walk.

146
00:09:32,320 --> 00:09:33,630
My dear sister.

147
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:44,910
Oh,

148
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:47,120
and Yu Song.

149
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,720
You really think

150
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:55,550
you can steal her from me?

151
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,550
Let me tell you,

152
00:10:00,320 --> 00:10:02,320
she and I are the same kind of people.

153
00:10:04,510 --> 00:10:06,360
We're both monsters in the dark,

154
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:08,720
who can never live in the light,

155
00:10:09,510 --> 00:10:12,790
and can only keep each other warm.

156
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,720
You'll never understand.

157
00:10:20,630 --> 00:10:21,630
And you'll

158
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,910
never get in.

159
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:44,150
Yu Song.

160
00:10:45,120 --> 00:10:46,360
Is everything set?

161
00:10:46,720 --> 00:10:47,419
Don't worry.

162
00:10:47,461 --> 00:10:48,440
It's all taken care of.

163
00:10:48,550 --> 00:10:49,440
Good.

164
00:10:49,750 --> 00:10:51,129
I found

165
00:10:51,171 --> 00:10:52,630
a care facility overseas.

166
00:10:53,510 --> 00:10:55,120
It's perfect for Huan's recovery.

167
00:10:56,320 --> 00:10:57,870
Let's get her sent over
as soon as possible,

168
00:10:58,080 --> 00:10:59,150
alright?

169
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,790
Okay. Don't worry.

170
00:11:09,910 --> 00:11:10,720
Yu Song.

171
00:11:12,360 --> 00:11:14,440
If you weren't here with me,

172
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:17,600
I really wouldn't know what to do.

173
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:22,120
I'm here.

174
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,120
It's okay now.

175
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:25,910
It's alright.
